    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d198">

                <pb facs="0349" n="177" xml:id="pg177"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 701.6311/269</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador-in Austria-Hungary</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Penfield</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-03-14T15:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 14, 1917, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received March 16, 12.30
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1760. My 1746, March 6, 3 p.m. Minister for Foreign Affairs pressing daily to
                    know why Tarnowski not fully received.
                    Emperor Charles has asked Minister for
                    Foreign Affairs for information and lean foresee prospect of difficulties
                    here.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Penfield</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
